# a33 side B: a25 config + MXFP4 indexer K cache on the target layers (vLLM #61985 backported, scripts/make_idxfp4_overlay.py;
# MTP draft layer 78 kept on FP8; Triton top-k hooked into the MXFP4 decode path), on prefill and decode. Numerics change
# (indexer scores from MXFP4 K): gate first (GSM8K, long context, garbage, real acceptance), then score. Decode KV ~+2.9%.
S_TAG=a33B-idxfp4-pmnbt4096-plongthr2048-topkv3-a8cfg-3600
